{"2611170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DAVY x JONES", "steam_appid": 2611170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the Crew</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/ad6159d88adf44b8d631b735cc6fe303.avif?t=1765790443\" width=740 height=240 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>In death, the legend of Davy Jones splits in two:</strong> the Head that commands, and the Body that fights.</i><br>    <br><i> Bound together in a cursed alliance, you must carve your way through The Locker — a pirate underworld shattered into islands floating on an infinite Sea of Clouds. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fight, fly, and conquer hell itself to reclaim your legend.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/47ee9b5ee1f881d7048c2fc28f4af61c.poster.avif?t=1765790443\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/47ee9b5ee1f881d7048c2fc28f4af61c.webm?t=1765790443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>JONES — The Body, The Fighter, The Ground</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Control the powerful, headless body — <strong>Jones</strong> — and push through everything that stands in your way. Master visceral first-person combat with sword, gun and your own talking skull — <strong>Davy</strong> — who cracks wise and guides the way. <br>    <br><strong>Explore the shattered islands of The Locker</strong> — an open pirate underworld of cursed shores, sunken ruins, and secrets waiting beneath the fog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every treasure you claim, every soul you free, and every victory on the ground fuels your might in the skies — <strong>because death here is only the beginning.</strong>  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/f3ec9937953cbef845f5c36fff962e5e.poster.avif?t=1765790443\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/f3ec9937953cbef845f5c36fff962e5e.webm?t=1765790443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DAVY — The Head, The Captain, The Sky</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Command the skies as <strong>Davy</strong> — the sharp-tongued captain’s skull who never stopped scheming, even after death. <br><strong>Take the helm of Abby</strong>, your colossal living ship — <strong>half whale, half war machine</strong> — and soar across the infinite Sea of Clouds. <br> <br>Recruit Officers with unique powers, upgrade your ship, and lead them into evolving roguelite Hunts filled with explosive sky battles and colossal <strong>Behemoths</strong>. <br> <br>Strategize, adapt, and abordage enemy vessels as you carve your way to power. <br>Every victory in the skies strengthens your dominion on the ground — <strong>and every defeat only feeds the storm.</strong> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/3be45dde768e13b9b4352d5db544ff70.poster.avif?t=1765790443\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/3be45dde768e13b9b4352d5db544ff70.webm?t=1765790443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grand Pirate Action-Adventure:</strong> A story-driven journey through a surreal underworld that bridges brutal land combat and epic sky battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BODY × HEAD:</strong> You are both the Muscle and the Brain. Control the headless body on the islands, and command the skies as the captain’s skull aboard your living ship, Abby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visceral First-Person Combat:</strong> Slash, shoot, and grapple through intense close-quarters encounters using your own skull as a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sail Your Living Ship:</strong> Gather your crew and command Abby across the endless Sea of Clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Hunts:</strong> Engage in evolving sky encounters and give Orders to shape each run — tactical choices that empower your crew with unique abilities and upgrades as you climb toward legendary Behemoths like the Kraken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Locker:</strong> Explore a pirate hell of shattered islands and infinite skies — where death is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two halves. <i>One purpose.</i><br>Grow into power, gather your crew, and conquer The Locker.<br><strong>Become the legend that hell itself couldn’t drown.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>In death, the legend of Davy Jones splits in two:</strong> the Head that commands, and the Body that fights.</i><br>    <br><i> Bound together in a cursed alliance, you must carve your way through The Locker — a pirate underworld shattered into islands floating on an infinite Sea of Clouds. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fight, fly, and conquer hell itself to reclaim your legend.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/47ee9b5ee1f881d7048c2fc28f4af61c.poster.avif?t=1765790443\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/47ee9b5ee1f881d7048c2fc28f4af61c.webm?t=1765790443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>JONES — The Body, The Fighter, The Ground</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Control the powerful, headless body — <strong>Jones</strong> — and push through everything that stands in your way. Master visceral first-person combat with sword, gun and your own talking skull — <strong>Davy</strong> — who cracks wise and guides the way. <br>    <br><strong>Explore the shattered islands of The Locker</strong> — an open pirate underworld of cursed shores, sunken ruins, and secrets waiting beneath the fog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every treasure you claim, every soul you free, and every victory on the ground fuels your might in the skies — <strong>because death here is only the beginning.</strong>  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/f3ec9937953cbef845f5c36fff962e5e.poster.avif?t=1765790443\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/f3ec9937953cbef845f5c36fff962e5e.webm?t=1765790443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DAVY — The Head, The Captain, The Sky</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Command the skies as <strong>Davy</strong> — the sharp-tongued captain’s skull who never stopped scheming, even after death. <br><strong>Take the helm of Abby</strong>, your colossal living ship — <strong>half whale, half war machine</strong> — and soar across the infinite Sea of Clouds. <br> <br>Recruit Officers with unique powers, upgrade your ship, and lead them into evolving roguelite Hunts filled with explosive sky battles and colossal <strong>Behemoths</strong>. <br> <br>Strategize, adapt, and abordage enemy vessels as you carve your way to power. <br>Every victory in the skies strengthens your dominion on the ground — <strong>and every defeat only feeds the storm.</strong> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/3be45dde768e13b9b4352d5db544ff70.poster.avif?t=1765790443\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/3be45dde768e13b9b4352d5db544ff70.webm?t=1765790443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grand Pirate Action-Adventure:</strong> A story-driven journey through a surreal underworld that bridges brutal land combat and epic sky battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BODY × HEAD:</strong> You are both the Muscle and the Brain. Control the headless body on the islands, and command the skies as the captain’s skull aboard your living ship, Abby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visceral First-Person Combat:</strong> Slash, shoot, and grapple through intense close-quarters encounters using your own skull as a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sail Your Living Ship:</strong> Gather your crew and command Abby across the endless Sea of Clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Hunts:</strong> Engage in evolving sky encounters and give Orders to shape each run — tactical choices that empower your crew with unique abilities and upgrades as you climb toward legendary Behemoths like the Kraken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Locker:</strong> Explore a pirate hell of shattered islands and infinite skies — where death is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two halves. <i>One purpose.</i><br>Grow into power, gather your crew, and conquer The Locker.<br><strong>Become the legend that hell itself couldn’t drown.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Command the skies. Crush the ground. Conquer The Locker. A grand action-adventure where you play as two halves of one legendary pirate — DAVY (Head) and JONES (Body). DAVY commands your flying ship in roguelite sky battles; JONES unleashes visceral first-person combat on the islands.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstati